    "evidence": "The patch introduces `ib_umem_check_rereg()` in `drivers/infiniband/core/umem.c` which explicitly checks `if (ib_access_writable(new_access_flags) && !umem->writable) return -EACCES;`, and the CVE description states \"If IB_MR_REREG_ACCESS changes from RO to RW then the umem has to be re-evaluated to ensure it is properly pinned as RW.\"",
